### Current-state evidence that closes old pending assumptions

- [x] `native_input_routing_live_spec.lua` mounts while a fullscreen overlay is
  already shown; proves consumed and fallthrough keyboard/mouse routing;
  dismisses and reshows the overlay without remounting; reuses a retained
